00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.080
Jadi aku yakin itu semua akan berhasil , entah bagaimana .

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.660
Nyonya Witches , terima kasih banyak !

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:16.120
Semoga selamat !

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:19.330
Um , keadaan aturan asosiasi

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:22.330
